## 📁 Architecture Overview

```text
Flow-Graph VAPT

├── src/flow_graph_vapt/
│   ├── main.py          # Entrypoint (CLI & REST Server)
│   ├── orchestrator.py  # Master Scanner Pipeline
│   ├── graph.py         # Application Flow Graph (NetworkX)
│   ├── extractor.py     # Identifier Extraction Engine
│   ├── classifier.py    # Object Type Inference Engine
│   ├── inventory.py     # Object Inventory Repository
│   ├── replay.py        # Replay & Request Mutation Engine
│   ├── analyzer.py      # Differential Response Analyzer
│   ├── crawler.py       # Playwright Authenticated Crawler
│   ├── proxy.py         # mitmproxy Ingestion Hook
│   ├── reporter.py      # Multi-Format Report Generator
│   ├── models.py        # Pydantic Schemas & Domain Models
│   ├── config.py        # Configuration Settings
│   └── exceptions.py    # Custom Exception Hierarchy
├── tests/               # Pytest Suite
└── reports/             # Generated BOLA Assessment Reports
```

